**20 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
